/ app-systems: every %!app.X% is the type X, and the plang path, the C# path and the file path say the same thing.
/ Done: 1–8h and 9a (done.list beside this goal). This goal is the plan's index and its validation:
/ each stage is a sub-goal, each comment a behaviour we want, and the step under it runs the test that proves it.
/ Tests live under this plan's folder at the path of what they test. Checks that can't be a test are in checks.md.
/ Built only when Ingi says so.
Start
- call Stage8h
- call Stage9
- call Stage10a
- call Stage10b
- call Stage10c
- call Stage10d
- call Stage10e
- call Stage11a
- call Stage11b
- call Stage11c
- call Stage12a
- call Stage12b

Stage8h
/ the builder builds itself, and plain words compile to what they mean (plus checks.md: the rebuild, the eval)
/ "retry once" is one retry
- call /plan/app-systems/module/on/error/RetryOnceMeansOneRetry
/ "if %done%, return %x%" returns from inside the if
- call /plan/app-systems/module/condition/if/IfReturnReturns
/ render takes its arguments by name
- call /plan/app-systems/module/ui/render/RenderTakesNamedArguments

Stage9
/ every value is born through its type, so a program can hook any value's birth (plus checks.md: the module pass)
/ "after file create" fires when a file value is born
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/file/CreateFiresOnBirth
/ converting a value to another type is a birth: "set %p% as path" fires "after path create"
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/path/AsPathIsABirth
/ a loop's item is the loop's own: it doesn't outlive the loop
- call /plan/app-systems/module/loop/foreach/LoopItemEndsWithTheLoop
/ the loop body's other writes reach the caller: a running total survives the loop
- call /plan/app-systems/module/loop/foreach/BodyWritesReachTheCaller
/ a call's parameter doesn't outlive the call; the caller's variable of that name is its own again
- call /plan/app-systems/module/goal/call/ParameterEndsWithTheCall
/ a callback's write reaches the caller; its %message% ends with it
- call /plan/app-systems/module/channel/set/CallbackWriteReachesTheCaller

Stage10a
/ registration: %!app.type.list% lists every type a program can use
/ the app lists its types
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/AppListsItsTypes
/ a plugin's type joins the app
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/PluginTypeJoinsTheApp
/ one name, one type: a plugin can't take a built-in's name (a clash fails loudly)
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/OneNameOneType

Stage10b
/ typed lists: list<text> is made by the type itself, a kind carries its element
/ a typed list holds its type
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/list/TypedListHoldsItsType
/ a list read doesn't copy itself

Stage10c
/ the app's facts are plang values
/ %!app.created% is a datetime, uptime a duration
- call /plan/app-systems/app/AppFactsArePlangValues
/ id, name and environment are the app's settings
- call /plan/app-systems/app/setting/AppNameIsItsSetting
/ a channel's settings are plang values
/ the app's identity is read back through the format that writes it; the store is ready when the app is

Stage10d
/ formats live with their owners: a type's formats are its kinds
/ json's writer and reader live with the json kind, text's with text, the step notation with the action
/ the test report's format is a real format kind (json, junit), each writing its own report file

Stage10e
/ one form of computed value: %Now% and %!event% are computed on each read, one way
/ two reads of %Now% differ, and a copy of it holds still
- call /plan/app-systems/app/variable/NowIsReadFresh

Stage11a
/ the actor is reached one way: %!app.actor.system% and %!app.actor.user%, no second app.System/app.User
- call /plan/app-systems/app/actor/OneDoorToAnActor

Stage11b
/ tests reach the app through its own doors (checks.md: every C# test passes with the test-only helpers gone)

Stage11c
/ nothing unreached goes unnoticed
/ the builder warns about goals nothing calls (checks.md)
/ the test report shows what the tests reached

Stage12a
/ the exception pass: a programmer's mistake reaches the result as an error with its own key, never a crash (plus the C# pins: KeepsItsKeyTests)
/ a value that takes no child is an error result
- call /plan/app-systems/app/type/item/SetChildOnAValueIsAnError
/ an unknown setting is an error result
- call /plan/app-systems/app/setting/UnknownSettingIsAnError

Stage12b
/ born knowing: a goal knows where it was loaded from when it's born, not stamped on after
/ closes on its C# pins (PrLoadTests: born holding its .pr, a refusal names the file), not a plan goal — see start.md, What tests can't show

/ Done, kept as validation that the modifiers-as-clauses logic works
Stage8g
/ each retry of an action gets a fresh deadline
- call /plan/app-systems/module/on/timeout/RetryGetsAFreshDeadline
/ a recovery's result is never served from the cache
- call /plan/app-systems/module/on/cache/RecoveryIsNeverCached
/ %!data% after an action with a clause is the action's result
- call /plan/app-systems/module/on/DataIsLeftAloneAfterAClause
